{
  "title": "Athletics",
  "slug": "athletics",
  "url": "https://www.scouting.org/merit-badges/athletics/",
  "eagle_required": false,
  "pamphlet_url": "https://filestore.scouting.org/filestore/Merit_Badge_ReqandRes/Pamphlets/Athletics.pdf",
  "requirements": [
    {
      "req_id": "1",
      "path": "1",
      "text": "Do the following:",
      "subrequirements": [
        {
          "req_id": "a",
          "path": "1.a",
          "text": "Explain to your counselor the most likely hazards you may encounter during athletics activities, and what you should do to anticipate, help prevent, mitigate, and respond to these hazards. Resource: Preventing Injuries in Youth Athletes (video)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Preventing Injuries in Youth Athletes (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/yC3blqv3kp4?si=TLnyOxBv96ZuyubP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "b",
          "path": "1.b",
          "text": "Show that you know first aid for injuries or illnesses that could occur while participating in athletics events, including sprains, strains, contusions, abrasions, blisters, dehydration, heat reactions, and concussions.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Using the Rice Method for Injuries - Rest, Ice, Compress, Elevate (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/TZqDBgiEfL8?si=RV6nOMJpa0Rc2LbT"
            },
            {
              "title": "First Aid Treatment for Wounds (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/oGvyiWfXB7c?si=VLL-rINKVqd871yO"
            },
            {
              "title": "Top 10 Most Common Sports Injuries (and How to Prevent Them!) (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/OcGeUdfL-s4?si=-4uuzL95rK4Is-T2"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subrequirement_mode": {
        "type": "all"
      }
    },
    {
      "req_id": "2",
      "path": "2",
      "text": "Do the following:",
      "subrequirements": [
        {
          "req_id": "a",
          "path": "2.a",
          "text": "Before completing requirements 3 and 5, have your health-care practitioner give you a physical examination, using the Scout Annual Health and Medical Record form. Resource: Annual Physical Exam (website)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Annual Physical Exam (website)",
              "url": "https://www.scouting.org/health-and-safety/ahmr/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "b",
          "path": "2.b",
          "text": "Explain the importance of a physical exam."
        },
        {
          "req_id": "c",
          "path": "2.c",
          "text": "Explain the importance of maintaining good health habits, especially during training—and how the use of tobacco products, alcohol, and other harmful substances can negatively affect your health and your performance in athletic activities.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Nutrition Tips for High School Athletes (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/dISDEsTr1Rc?si=4QkQnfQQjYs4GRuf"
            },
            {
              "title": "Refusing Use of Harmful Substances (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/_NUo_52vkkg?si=cy-fCChvsa8SVNQT"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "d",
          "path": "2.d",
          "text": "Explain the importance of maintaining a healthy diet. Resource: What is MyPlate? (website)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "What is MyPlate? (website)",
              "url": "https://www.myplate.gov/eat-healthy/what-is-myplate"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subrequirement_mode": {
        "type": "all"
      }
    },
    {
      "req_id": "3",
      "path": "3",
      "text": "Select an athletic activity that interests you, then do the following: Resource: Which Sport Are You Made for? Take Our 60-Second Test (website)",
      "resources": [
        {
          "title": "Which Sport Are You Made for? Take Our 60-Second Test (website)",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.com/news/uk-28062001"
        }
      ],
      "subrequirements": [
        {
          "req_id": "a",
          "path": "3.a",
          "text": "With guidance from your counselor, establish a personal training program suited to the activity you have chosen. Follow this training program for three months. Resource: Keys to Sport-Specific Training (video)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Keys to Sport-Specific Training (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/oRQEgV0wNtQ?si=5ZjJP2Lq6GboJ8E_"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "b",
          "path": "3.b",
          "text": "Create a chart to monitor your progress during this time. Resource: 7 Powerful Journaling Ideas for Youth Sports Athletes (website)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "7 Powerful Journaling Ideas for Youth Sports Athletes (website)",
              "url": "https://isport360.com/7-powerful-journaling-ideas-for-youth-sports-athletes/%20"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "c",
          "path": "3.c",
          "text": "Explain to your counselor the equipment necessary to participate in this activity and the appropriate clothing for the time of year. Resource: Equipment Needed to Play Various Sports (website)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Equipment Needed to Play Various Sports (website)",
              "url": "https://www.spookynooksports.com/blog/manheim/equipment-needed-to-play-sports%20"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "d",
          "path": "3.d",
          "text": "At the end of three months, review the chart you created for requirement 3(b), and discuss with your counselor what progress you have made during training. Tell how your development has affected you mentally and physically. Resource: How Do You Measure Progress? (video)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "How Do You Measure Progress? (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/EHZvmAaXwfk?si=rdzKWbgW6dHqMrRO"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subrequirement_mode": {
        "type": "all"
      }
    },
    {
      "req_id": "4",
      "path": "4",
      "text": "Do the following:",
      "subrequirements": [
        {
          "req_id": "a",
          "path": "4.a",
          "text": "Give the rules for two athletic activities, one of which is the activity you chose for requirement 3. Resource: Rules of Sports (website)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Rules of Sports (website)",
              "url": "https://www.rulesofsport.com/%20"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "b",
          "path": "4.b",
          "text": "Discuss the importance of warming up and cooling down. Resource: Stretching and Warming Up (video)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Stretching and Warming Up (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/XeEIoGMldyc?si=OXMS8XPru5l5dG7g"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "c",
          "path": "4.c",
          "text": "Explain to your counselor what an amateur athlete is and the differences between an amateur and a professional athlete. Resource: What Is an Amateur (PDF)",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "What Is an Amateur (PDF)",
              "url": "https://filestore.scouting.org/filestore/Merit_Badge_ReqandRes/Requirement%20Resources/Athletics/amateur_vs_professional.pdf"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "d",
          "path": "4.d",
          "text": "Discuss the traits and importance of good sportsmanship. Tell what role sportsmanship plays in both individual and group athletic activities.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "What is Good Sportsmanship? (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/KoDu2FpU57c?si=UgLWB7uM9iY3FQBj"
            },
            {
              "title": "Olympians' Display of Sportsmanship Fosters Positive Attitudes (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/rNcfqOqDbsU?si=2C-x-nzDi7v94t50"
            },
            {
              "title": "What Does Sportsmanship Mean to You (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/BvheyBiD6Qs?si=ZzEwe2jDYlgrIBaU"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subrequirement_mode": {
        "type": "all"
      }
    },
    {
