        {
          "req_id": "a",
          "path": "6.a",
          "text": "Prepare plans for conducting a sports meet or field day that includes 10 activities, at least five of which must come from the groups mentioned in requirement 5. Outline the duties of each official needed and list the equipment the meet will require. Resource: Planning a Field Day (video)",
